<% content_for :title, "Refund Policy — TrustShip" %>

<article class="print:bg-white">
  <div class="mb-8 rounded-xl border border-indigo-200 bg-indigo-50 px-4 py-4 text-center text-sm leading-relaxed text-indigo-950 sm:px-6 sm:text-base print:border-gray-200 print:bg-gray-50 print:text-gray-800">
    <p class="font-medium">
      TrustShip is currently free. This refund policy applies when paid plans are introduced.
    </p>
  </div>

  <header class="border-b border-gray-200 pb-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 md:text-4xl">Refund Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">Last updated: June 2025</p>
  </header>

  <nav class="mt-10 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-5 text-sm print:hidden" aria-label="Table of contents">
    <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">On this page</p>
    <ol class="mt-4 grid list-decimal gap-x-8 gap-y-2 pl-5 text-gray-700 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <li class="pl-1"><a href="#overview" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Overview</a></li>
      <li class="pl-1"><a href="#early-access" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Early Access Period (Current)</a></li>
      <li class="pl-1"><a href="#subscription-plans" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Subscription Plans (When Introduced)</a></li>
      <li class="pl-1"><a href="#how-to-request" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">How to Request a Refund</a></li>
      <li class="pl-1"><a href="#exceptional" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Exceptional Circumstances</a></li>
      <li class="pl-1"><a href="#cancellation" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Cancellation</a></li>
      <li class="pl-1"><a href="#payment-method" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Payment Method</a></li>
      <li class="pl-1"><a href="#contact" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Contact</a></li>
    </ol>
  </nav>

  <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 print:hidden">
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-indigo-100 bg-indigo-50/80 px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm leading-snug text-indigo-950">
      <p class="font-semibold text-indigo-900">Free trial — cancel anytime, no charge</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-indigo-100 bg-indigo-50/80 px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm leading-snug text-indigo-950">
      <p class="font-semibold text-indigo-900">Cancel within 48 hours — full refund, monthly plans</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-indigo-100 bg-indigo-50/80 px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm leading-snug text-indigo-950">
      <p class="font-semibold text-indigo-900">Cancel within 7 days — full refund, annual plans</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-12 space-y-12 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
    <section id="overview" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">1. Overview</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        TrustShip is committed to being fair and transparent about our refund policy. This page explains what happens if you are charged and want a refund.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4">
        Currently TrustShip is free during Early Access — no charges apply and no refund policy is active. This policy will come into effect when paid subscription plans are introduced.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4">
        We will notify all users at least 30 days before any charges apply.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="early-access" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">2. Early Access Period (Current)</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">TrustShip is completely free during Early Access.</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
        <li>No credit card required</li>
        <li>No charges of any kind</li>
        <li>No refund needed — nothing is charged</li>
        <li>This policy will be updated when paid plans launch</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="subscription-plans" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">3. Subscription Plans (When Introduced)</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        When TrustShip introduces paid subscription plans, the following refund policy will apply:
      </p>

      <h3 id="free-trial" class="mt-8 scroll-mt-24 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800">3a. Free Trial</h3>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
        <li>All plans will include a free trial period</li>
        <li>No charges during free trial</li>
        <li>You can cancel anytime during trial — no questions asked</li>
        <li>No refund needed as no payment is taken during trial</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 id="monthly" class="mt-8 scroll-mt-24 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800">3b. Monthly Subscriptions</h3>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
        <li>You are billed at the start of each monthly billing cycle</li>
        <li>If you cancel within 48 hours of being charged — full refund, no questions asked</li>
        <li>If you cancel after 48 hours — no refund for current billing cycle, access continues until cycle ends</li>
        <li>No partial or pro-rata refunds for unused days</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 id="annual" class="mt-8 scroll-mt-24 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800">3c. Annual Subscriptions</h3>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
        <li>You are billed upfront for the full year</li>
        <li>If you cancel within 7 days of annual charge — full refund, no questions asked</li>
        <li>If you cancel between 7–30 days — pro-rata refund for remaining months, minus one month</li>
        <li>If you cancel after 30 days — no refund, access continues until annual period ends</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 id="not-refundable" class="mt-8 scroll-mt-24 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800">3d. What Is Not Refundable</h3>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
        <li>Any months already used</li>
        <li>Setup or onboarding fees if applicable</li>
        <li>Charges from third party services (Meta WhatsApp API conversation charges etc.)</li>
        <li>Accounts terminated for violating <%= link_to "Terms of Service", terms_path, class: "font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500" %></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="how-to-request" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">4. How to Request a Refund</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">To request a refund when paid plans are active:</p>
      <ol class="mt-4 list-decimal space-y-2 pl-6">
        <li>Email hello@trustship.in with subject: &ldquo;Refund Request — [Your Account Email]&rdquo;</li>
        <li>Include your reason for cancellation</li>
        <li>We will respond within 2 business days</li>
        <li>Approved refunds processed within 5–7 business days to original payment method via Razorpay</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="mt-4">
        We do not require lengthy justification — if you are within the refund window, we will process it.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="exceptional" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">5. Exceptional Circumstances</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        We understand things happen. Outside standard refund windows, we consider refunds in genuine exceptional cases:
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
        <li>Serious technical failure on TrustShip&apos;s side preventing service use</li>
        <li>Duplicate charge due to payment error</li>
        <li>Charge after confirmed cancellation</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-4">
        Email hello@trustship.in with details. We review each case individually and aim to be fair.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="cancellation" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">6. Cancellation</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 font-medium text-gray-800">Cancelling your subscription:</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
        <li>Cancel anytime from your dashboard under Settings → Subscription</li>
        <li>Cancellation stops future charges immediately</li>
        <li>Access continues until end of current billing period</li>
        <li>No penalty for cancellation at any time</li>
        <li>Early Access users can simply stop using the platform — no cancellation needed as no charges apply</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="payment-method" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">7. Payment Method</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        All payments and refunds are processed via Razorpay. Refunds go back to the original payment method:
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
        <li>UPI — 1–3 business days</li>
        <li>Credit/Debit card — 5–7 business days</li>
        <li>Net banking — 3–5 business days</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-4">
        TrustShip does not hold or transfer refunds via any other method.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">8. Contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">Questions about our refund policy?</p>
      <p class="mt-3">
        <strong class="font-semibold text-gray-800">Email:</strong> hello@trustship.in
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4">
        We aim to respond within 2 business days. We are a small team and we genuinely care — if something feels unfair, just reach out.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <p class="mt-14 border-t border-gray-200 pt-10 print:mt-8">
    <%= link_to "← Back to Home", root_path, class: "text-sm font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500" %>
  </p>
</article>
